            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Charbswims"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this tonight. Super easy and quick to prepare. I did mix all ingredients in a small saucepan and heated for about 5 minutes until well blended and warm. Excellent with fried wontons.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-29T18:41:11.580Z"
          },
          {
