            },
            "reviewBody": "Tried it. Way too much soy sauce, vinegar and sesame oil. Disappointed.\n\nMade my own version with 2T rice wine vinegar, 2T soy, honey to taste, 1/4 cup water, 3 T orange ginger sauce, dash of sesame oil. Perfect.",
